       ssiiggiissmmeemmbbeerr() tests whether _s_i_g_n_u_m is a member of _s_e_t.

       Objects  of  type  _s_i_g_s_e_t___t  must  be  initialized  by a call to either
       ssiiggeemmppttyysseett() or ssiiggffiillllsseett() before  being  passed  to  the  functions
